  - m_Id: 24558171962179584
    m_Localized: An experienced fighter who has visited many hot spots around the
      world. It would take a long time to list his awards, but one thing is for sure
      - Rambo is the best of the best, the real elite of the armed forces. Rambo
      is skilled with melee weapons like this (+20% to damage and speed of using
      SMGs and shotguns).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565575860846592
    m_Localized: 'Booth is an experienced operative specializing in espionage operations.
      He is extremely secretive, it is difficult to say how many operations he has
      taken part in or even how old he is or whether his name is really Booth. We
      can only say with confidence that he has eliminated many terrorist groups and
      is eliminating more than one.

      Pistol damage +50%.

      Speed of using
      pistols and automatic rifles +10%.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565592822611968
    m_Localized: Boot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565614632992768
    m_Localized: Rambo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565635059253248
    m_Localized: Shadow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565712016343040
    m_Localized: 'The Shadow is an eternal silent person who prefers loneliness to
      any company. Behind his modest character lies a master of murder who leaves
      no chance for his victims. There is no person in the world who can hide from
      a Shadow''s bullet.

      +20% damage to sniper rifles.

      +25% speed
      of using sniper rifles.

      +25% accuracy and -20% firing speed for all
      weapons.

      +5% chance for critical attacks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565760913539072
    m_Localized: Last Blood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565942598205440
    m_Localized: 'When activated, Rambo stops feeling pain and taking damage for
      some time.

      If the next damage taken is fatal and the ability is ready
      to be used, it will activate automatically.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24565980846063616
    m_Localized: Supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24566015482626048
    m_Localized: When activated, grants 10% health and 5% armor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24567533216694272
    m_Localized: 'Using the ability slows down time for a while.

      Opponents
      are slowed down more than Booth.'
