  - m_Id: 31058410890035200
    m_Localized: If you have additional skill charges, deal 75% more damage, and
      if you don't have them, deal 25% less damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31058460814835712
    m_Localized: Grudge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31058510748024832
    m_Localized: When receiving damage, your own damage increases by 15% for 5 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31058639177613312
    m_Localized: Second chance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31058694127190016
    m_Localized: When receiving lethal damage, restore 10% of your maximum health.
      The skill disappears after triggering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31058773680553984
    m_Localized: Dead soul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31058827006935040
    m_Localized: Having received lethal damage, become invulnerable for 5 seconds,
      if during this time you do not replenish your health, you will die. The skill
      disappears after triggering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31058899727777792
    m_Localized: Paranormal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31058952466956288
    m_Localized: Maximum health drops to 1 unit. The amount of armor triples.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31059004375662592
    m_Localized: Live meat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31059096268668928
    m_Localized: Every second, 4% of your maximum health is converted into missing
      armor. As a result of using the ability, health cannot fall below 20%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31059159950786560
    m_Localized: Rescuer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31059214011170816
    m_Localized: After receiving lethal damage, restore 10% of your health, if within
      5 seconds after the ability is triggered you do not kill a single enemy, you
      will die. The skill disappears after triggering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31059289005326336
    m_Localized: Bloody ammunition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31059340918226944
    m_Localized: When the magazine is empty, you continue to fire, dealing 2% more
      damage per shot, and losing 1% of your maximum health per shot. It is possible
      to die as a result of using a skill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31059392487194624
    m_Localized: Stock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31059441489248256
    m_Localized: Lose 50% of your maximum armor and 50% of your maximum health. Gain
      2 extra lives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31059523341090816
    m_Localized: Anemia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31059578219364352
    m_Localized: Maximum health is doubled. Take 10% more damage from all sources.
